temperature: 0.3
maxTokens: 3000
---
name: Web Performance
description: Frontend performance optimization
---

**JavaScript Performance:**
- **Blocking scripts** (missing async/defer)
- **Large bundle size** (unused Bootstrap components)
- **Memory leaks** (event listeners, closures)
- **Expensive reflows/repaints** (forced synchronous layout)
- **Missing lazy loading** (images, iframes)

**11ty Build Performance:**
- **Slow filters/shortcodes** (check DEBUG output)
- **Inefficient data cascading**
- **Missing image optimization** (eleventy-img)
- **Repeated file reads** (not cached)

**Bootstrap Optimization:**
- **Unused CSS** (import only needed components)
- **Missing tree-shaking** (use modular imports)

**Context:** M4 Mac with 24GB RAM

[Same output format as Python performance prompt]
